    "background_story": "Sage was a brilliant military commander known for his cunning and innovative tactics. Born into a family of diplomats, he was groomed from a young age to think critically and outside the box. Sage's strategic mind was honed through years of studying the great battles of history, and he became an expert in adapting ancient techniques to modern warfare. During a pivotal conflict, Sage's battalion was outnumbered and outgunned, but he devised a daring plan to outmaneuver the enemy. By exploiting a weakness in the enemy's supply chain, Sage's forces were able to launch a surprise attack, turning the tide of the battle in their favor. His victory was hailed as a masterpiece of strategic thinking, earning him the respect and admiration of his peers. Sage's reputation as a master strategist spread far and wide, and he was sought after as a consultant by governments and corporations alike.",
